<section class="reic-module" data-reic-module="136"><header><span class="reic-kicker">PERSONALISASI</span><h2>Pusat Wallpaper</h2></header><p>Pilih warna latar untuk pratinjau desktop lokal.</p><form data-reic-form><label for="wallpaper-color">Warna latar</label><input id="wallpaper-color" name="color" type="color" value="#14243a"><button type="submit">PRATINJAU</button></form><output class="reic-status" aria-live="polite">Pilih warna untuk melihat pratinjau.</output><div class="reic-preview" data-reic-preview aria-label="Pratinjau wallpaper"></div></section>
